---
import Info from '../layouts/Info.astro';
import { sitePath } from '../site-path.js';
---
<Info title="How to verify your purchase" description="Verify your Epic Games order to get product support and access to private Discord support channels for eelDev plugins.">
  <p class="lead">Verify your order to receive support for the eelDev products you own.</p>
  <section>
    <h2>Find and send your order ID</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>Open your <a href="https://www.unrealengine.com/account/transactions">Epic Games transaction history</a>.</li>
      <li>Select the product description to expand the purchase details.</li>
      <li>Copy the order ID and email it to <a href="mailto:support@eeldev.com">support@eeldev.com</a>. Include your Discord username if you want access to the private support channels for your products.</li>
    </ol>
    <a href={sitePath('/help-images/order-id.png')}><img src={sitePath('/help-images/order-id.png')} width="898" height="420" alt="An expanded transaction showing where to find the order ID" loading="lazy" /></a>
  </section>
  <section>
    <h2>Confirmation</h2>
    <p>You’ll receive a confirmation email after verification. Requests sent outside <a href={sitePath('/help/#hours')}>support hours</a> or over the weekend take longer. If you included your Discord details, you’ll also receive the roles for your products.</p>
  </section>
</Info>
